OL,3,GNEWSAHigh Court quashes decision to
OL,4,Arestrict annual Drumcree parade
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decision by the Parades Commission to
OL,7,Fimpose restrictions on one of the most
OL,8,Fcontentious parades in Northern Ireland
OL,9,Fhas been quashed in the High Court.
OL,11,FIt follows a legal challenge brought by
OL,12,Fa member of the Orange Order over its
OL,13,Fannual parade at Drumcree outside
OL,14,FPortadown.
OL,16,FThe commission had banned this year's
OL,17,Fparade from entering the mainly
OL,18,Fnationalist Garvaghy Road - a move
OL,19,Fwhich reflected every decision it has
OL,20,Fmade since 1998.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
